flowchart TD
    A([Start])
    --> B[Open Role Matrix]
    --> C[Add or remove Permission]
    --> D{Dependencies valid?}

    D -- No --> E[Reject change]
    --> F[Explain dependency]
    --> C

    D -- Yes --> G{Protected capability removed?}

    G -- Yes --> H[Reject entire change]
    --> I[Record rejected attempt]
    --> C

    G -- No --> J[Calculate impact]
    --> K[Show affected employee count]
    --> L[Save changes]
    --> M[Record audit]
    --> N([Completed])
